{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0334_1000_p", "source_sha256": "9100b3e58b511c0c76c322f5a13c825d9618243ccb551fa12ec706561809e3be", "ja": "（今度、恵美が町を歩く番組に出演することになった。\n下見も兼ねて、今日は一緒にでかけている……）", "zh": "（下次，惠美要出演一档在街上漫步的节目。今天就当作踩点，和她一起出门了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0334_1001_020meg", "source_sha256": "da9870877da9be486967119324358f9eee3496a353b6a48c361204c9572047dc", "ja": "やっぱり、この辺りのお店はオシャレだなぁ。\nテンション上がるー！　ね、{$P$}♪", "zh": "这一带的店果然都很时髦呢。\n情绪一下子就上来了～！对吧，{$P$}♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0334_1002_020meg", "source_sha256": "7593a7664836508507c22ddb2c23d1987d0c05e1873165393ec7cb1dde8eaefb", "ja": "って、どしたの？　さっきから妙に静かだけど。\nもしかして、疲れちゃった？", "zh": "怎么了？从刚才开始就格外安静。\n难道是累了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0334_1003_p", "source_sha256": "a65160d0f98806290868f43fdfc88fc97ab747383d79726f561fe299422448ee", "ja": "いや、まだ元気はあるよ。ただ不思議だと思って。\n本番に備えての下見って……。", "zh": "不，我还挺精神的。只是觉得有点不可思议。\n说是为了正式演出做准备而踩点……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0334_1004_020meg", "source_sha256": "1a64b9ae0f70e0afa65612ae65bf51a8e76d118dcb4730d3d8fe3b1e03dc0edd", "ja": "えっ？　そ、そうかな～？\nほら、それだけ気合いが入ってるってことだよ！", "zh": "咦？是、是这样吗～？\n你看，这就说明干劲十足嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0334_1005_020meg", "source_sha256": "cf18ac79e547b01952cb952a8b5d7fcf16d03a0b573919424814a320665f3e6c", "ja": "確認しておけば、リアクションもとりやすいしね。\n本番もスムーズに進んで、いいことばかりじゃん？", "zh": "提前确认好的话，反应也更容易拿捏嘛。\n正式录制也能顺顺利利的，全是好事不是吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0334_1006_p", "source_sha256": "979ee666f322aec12b7010ad39d42bae896958f18f199f8abd1ea00ca6edb532", "ja": "そうか。一理あるけど……番組的には、\n新鮮なリアクションが欲しいんじゃないかな？", "zh": "这样啊。确实有道理，不过……从节目效果来说，应该还是想要新鲜的反应吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0334_1007_020meg", "source_sha256": "43406f12e2b1976e67018d2cb7aa99e52b0e1c450a9996862d15d6eb3fb2350a", "ja": "{$P$}は、固いっ！　細かいことは\n一旦置いといて、楽しもうよ。オフなんだからさ♪", "zh": "{$P$}，太死板啦！细节就先别管了，\n好好享受嘛。毕竟今天可是休息日呀♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0334_1008_020meg", "source_sha256": "463cdfefd8bb52332b2c1bf651963354f4949af3456d9ab27aaec43b211b785f", "ja": "そんなことより！　{$P$}って、\nこの辺とか、よく遊びにきたりするの？", "zh": "先不说那个！{$P$}，你平时会经常来这一带玩吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0334_1009_p", "source_sha256": "725f87efa7b886f84ad8eb08adbf894f781cdd386fd7e81a546ee0f0661c575c", "ja": "時々、情報収集にくるかな。話題のスポットとか\n人気のお店を知らないと、話についていけないからな。", "zh": "偶尔会来收集一些信息吧。不了解热门地点和人气店铺的话，聊天就跟不上了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0334_1010_020meg", "source_sha256": "f77685e3dba97d42549345f49b892f44478cf9185b21e3816a372b25a201552c", "ja": "ええ～！？　それ、全然遊びじゃないじゃん！\n要するに、仕事できてるってことでしょ？", "zh": "诶～！？那根本就不是在玩嘛！也就是说，你其实是在工作吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0334_1011_p", "source_sha256": "5f46aa338aae89d66457e2d1a17500dc04fb4615ea8b29cbaf332c82926f39f3", "ja": "えっ？　言われてみれば、確かに……。", "zh": "咦？这么一说，确实是这样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0334_1012_020meg", "source_sha256": "cc569b281dfee0be95537a4a4719c60fba230156155858487562631fb246674c", "ja": "もう……働き過ぎっ！　たまには仕事を忘れて、\nう～～～んと羽伸ばさないと。息が詰まっちゃうよ？", "zh": "真是的……工作过头了！偶尔也得把工作抛到脑后，痛痛快快放松一下。不然会憋坏的哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0334_1013_p", "source_sha256": "432643fabb1fbba8569f4359d09b40ab2e04aaf3e7407122eafd3e72623adb12", "ja": "そうだな。恵美の言うとおりだ。\n心配してくれて、ありがとうな。", "zh": "是啊。就像惠美说的那样。\n谢谢你担心我。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0334_1014_020meg", "source_sha256": "2183d14fefe5f1fde7ec2928db875d66fcdb1da2ff04a869822ddaa7d1525a71", "ja": "ホントだよ！　アタシたちのために頑張ってるのは\nわかるけど、倒れてからじゃ遅いんだからね。", "zh": "真的！我知道你是在为我们努力，可要是累倒了就晚了啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0334_1015_020meg", "source_sha256": "3e9b767921b9f1c750540254531ad10f9b21571993dd7ba36fcb2e57a82ad8b4", "ja": "こうやって、アタシが連れ出さなかったら、\nまーた休みの日も仕事してたでしょー？", "zh": "要不是我像这样把你带出来，你肯定又要连休息日都工作了吧——？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0334_1016_p", "source_sha256": "6c91d655fa28d7cab9eeec9ce5dd3a2e546ce17a879aac25804c1c0175294871", "ja": "うっ……そのとおりです。でも、恵美こそ程々にな。\nせっかくのオフを、仕事の下見に使って……。", "zh": "呃……确实如此。不过，惠美你才是，适可而止吧。难得的休息日，居然拿来踩点工作……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0334_1017_020meg", "source_sha256": "97669b1f52e287f1b0f168f28be71d5df5896c148884997df48f03ddfbda71d6", "ja": "もーう！　ホント細かーいっ！\nオフなんだから、頭空っぽにして楽しめばいいの！", "zh": "真是的！你也太较真了吧！\n难得休息，就该什么都别想，好好享受嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0334_1018_020meg", "source_sha256": "84daf705d591ef7ae6da90f40a2790308f0db3e523a91f54d96349744c973799", "ja": "今日は行きたいとこ、いっぱいあるんだからね。\nほら、歩いた歩いた～！", "zh": "今天想去的地方可多着呢。\n来，走啦走啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0334_1019_p", "source_sha256": "efc62f96fb3f24a638782ea060375c92742006ab72a36cacd0af9dfd9c115ba6", "ja": "（その後、恵美と一緒にいろいろな場所へ行った……。\nとてもいい休日を過ごせた気がする。楽しかったな！）", "zh": "（之后，我和惠美一起去了各种各样的地方……感觉度过了一个非常棒的休息日。真开心啊！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
